29:10.324 --> 29:12.729
with the money. It comes out of the bond. It gets released to make the

29:13.229 --> 29:16.389
last payment. But it's a cushion there. If it's TIF only,

29:16.405 --> 29:19.519
again, if you're a bondholder, got your bondholder hat on, if it's

29:19.535 --> 29:23.050
TIF only and the development's

29:23.550 --> 29:26.983
slow or whatever happens that means that there's a little bit

29:27.483 --> 29:30.177
