29:30.771 --> 29:34.575
Right? If the city— so you go to option 3. If the

29:34.624 --> 29:38.011
city chooses to backstop it with a subordinate Sales tax pledge,

29:38.476 --> 29:42.025
we don't need to fund that reserve because your you know current

29:42.525 --> 29:45.509
sales tax bond rating I think is a double A minus,

29:46.328 --> 29:50.374
and it's viewed as a very strong credit. You have gobs

29:50.874 --> 29:53.714
