03:15:26.773 --> 03:15:30.370
been held to that standard and then it changes. I just think there's a lot

03:15:30.870 --> 03:15:34.237
of ambiguity in it. And I just

03:15:34.737 --> 03:15:37.765
see it as a code enforcement nightmare. How do you know?

03:15:37.989 --> 03:15:41.902
And when you're bringing an application, well, does it still apply

03:15:41.918 --> 03:15:45.879
or is it outdated? When did we update it last? And I just hear all

03:15:45.943 --> 03:15:49.135
of these arguments from the individual property owners when they're

03:15:49.635 --> 03:15:52.967
trying to build an accessory dwelling. I'll just add to that.

03:15:53.465 --> 03:15:57.121
In my— I'm just thinking of my neighbors. We live by

03:15:57.169 --> 03:16:00.263
Airport Road. 80-foot setback for an

03:16:00.295 --> 03:16:04.095
