03:16:08.391 --> 03:16:12.046
You have to push all of your sheds, all of the outbuildings

03:16:12.639 --> 03:16:16.150
toward your house when I'd rather have them back, you know, up against

03:16:16.650 --> 03:16:19.340
my fence. I have neighbors who have horses, they have,

03:16:20.799 --> 03:16:23.973
