03:17:16.544 --> 03:17:20.280
I'll close the public hearing.

03:17:20.634 --> 03:17:22.904
And if we have to do it again, we'll have to re-notice. It's 8:26.

03:17:22.952 --> 03:17:26.754
We'll close the public hearing and bring it back to the council for further

03:17:27.254 --> 03:17:30.606
