03:21:35.372 --> 03:21:38.517
City, Utah, amending Eagle Mountain Municipal Code Chapter 17.10.030,

03:21:40.980 --> 03:21:44.261
Definitions, and 17.25.040,

03:21:44.277 --> 03:21:46.502
Residential Development Standards.

03:21:50.292 --> 03:21:54.022
Second. I have a motion by Council Member Wood and a second by Council Member

03:21:54.522 --> 03:21:57.786
Wright, and we will start the vote with Council Member Huish.

03:21:59.017 --> 03:22:02.282
Yes. Council Member Clark. Yes. Council Member

03:22:02.782 --> 03:22:06.450
Wright? Yes. Yes. Yes. All right,

03:22:06.611 --> 03:22:09.444
